        "cue": "pop",
        "sub": "The shell bursts",
        "sub_cue": "bursts"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Why does it turn fluffy and white?"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "The soft starch puffs out into a white foam. It cools fast and turns into the crunchy, fluffy popcorn you eat.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "☁️",
        "text": "Starch puffs into foam",
        "cue": "puffs",
        "sub": "Fluffy and crunchy",
        "sub_cue": "fluffy"
